<Layout title="Credits — TigerFury Fixes" description="The people, tools and artwork behind TigerFury Fixes."><div class="shell detail credits-page"><a class="text-link" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL}>← Home</a><p class="eyebrow mt-10">THE PEOPLE & TOOLS BEHIND THE FIXES</p><h1>Credits &amp; acknowledgements</h1><p class="lead">Classic games live on through the work of their creators and the communities that keep playing them.</p><section class="credit-section"><h2>TigerFury projects</h2><p>Compatibility fixes, RetroInput development and channel videos by <a href="https://github.com/Tiger-Fury">TigerFury</a>. Project documentation and release notes provide the credits and instructions specific to each download.</p><div class="guide-links"><a href="https://github.com/Tiger-Fury/RetroInput-Public#credits">RetroInput credits ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/Tiger-Fury/Crime-Scene-Investigation---CSI-AiO-Fix">CSI: Crime Scene Investigation ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/Tiger-Fury/CSI-Dark-Motives-AiO-Fix">CSI: Dark Motives ↗</a></div></section><section class="credit-section"><h2>RetroInput contributors &amp; tools</h2><ul><li><a href="https://github.com/ThirteenAG">ThirteenAG</a> — creator of <a href="https://github.com/ThirteenAG/Ultimate-ASI-Loader">Ultimate ASI Loader</a>, used to load the game DLLs. The loader’s MIT licence is included in RetroInput packages.</li><li><a href="https://juliocacko.itch.io/">JulioCacko</a> — controller button icons used in RetroInput’s platform artwork packs. See the project’s credits and bundled notices.</li></ul></section><section class="credit-section"><h2>Website tools</h2><p>Built with <a href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> and <a href="https://tailwindcss.com/">Tailwind CSS</a>. Social icons from <a href="https://simpleicons.org/">Simple Icons</a>, distributed under CC0. Platform logos remain the marks of their respective owners.</p></section></div></Layout>
